description: Never read or print local install4j / Apple / SignPath secrets
alwaysApply: true
---

# Local secrets

**Never Read, Grep, Glob, or print** these paths (existence / byte-size only):

- `packaging/macos/**` — Apple Developer ID / App Store Connect files on Windows. Entire folder. Do not list filenames.
- repo-root `signpath/**` — same Apple material on the Mini
- `install4j/license.txt` and `install4j/license*.txt`
- `packaging/signpath/**` except `packaging/signpath/README.txt` and tracked `artifact-configurations/`
- `*.p12` `*.p8` `*.pfx`

Do not paste Team ID, license keys, app-specific passwords, or keystore passwords into chat or commits.
`.cursorignore` and `.gitignore` must keep blocking `packaging/macos/`.
